", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          品种：瑰夏 Gesha\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          海拔：1400+米 masl\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          采摘月份：2024.1月\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          空运到港：2024.7月\n          <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          处理方式：啤酒酵母+乳酸菌厌氧蜜处理\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           Depulped &amp; fermented with Kviek voss &amp; lactobacillus plantarum Anaerobic Honey\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍‍‍‍‍‍\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n          烘焙度：浅度 Light Roasted\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          风味：‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍洋甘菊、茉莉绿茶、黄柠檬、蔓越莓、红布林\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          Floral,\n          <span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n           Jasmine tea-like, Lemon, Cranberry, Red plum\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          这是我们买的第二个Lost Origin处理的Don Benjie批次，这一批次比去年的好喝很多啊！\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          入口很茉莉绿茶，是白色花香复合着黄柠檬和柚子皮的柑橘类果香，随后酸质感受像柠檬，蔓越莓和红布林在一起的感受，很细腻，甜感很饱满像红糖水，好喝，特别好喝！\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          处理过程：\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n          鲜果采收后用特制的塑料箱储存，并通过冷藏车运送至巴拿马城Lost Origin的处理厂。鲜果去皮后放置在发酵罐中，加入克维克酵母Kveik Voss、戴尔有孢圆酵母Torulaspora delbrueckii、毕赤克鲁维酵母Pichia kluyveri和乳酸菌 L.plantarum，它们的相互作用能够产生多种芳香族化合物。为了使得发酵过程更加充分，发酵罐中还加入了150升水和酵母所需营养物质。最后将咖啡放置在湿度50%温度20摄氏度的环境中干燥13天。\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlaO8st3wWJAg8NrbKv0ymTtX1xo0yeJBml4nzPibBlPff0RqafqOu42FQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7SkB6M2kMYzk2Ea1BO4eOlajZ0qxia4sy1AmyTOCTwWo9icdSZb4AR6NO727rjxvdCVMQicHCBKdOONg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\"/>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;visibility: visible;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;visibility: visible;\">\n           关于Don Benjie\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          Café Don Benjie庄园占地 33 公顷，位于巴拿马的波魁特镇北部的\n          <span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           巴霍莫诺（\n          </span>\n</span>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          Bajo Mono Canyon\n         </span>\n<span style='color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: var(--articleFontsize);letter-spacing: 0.034em;'>\n          ）\n         </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;'>\n          峡谷地带\n         </span>\n<span style='color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          ，靠近巴鲁火山山脊的加勒比海一侧，火山土壤，自然泉水喷泉、柑橘树、香蕉、大蕉、鳄梨等热带水果和树木遮荫，以这种独特的“风土”为特色咖啡庄园。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjXgq6sw1LLmyovqFP1c4ibca8DMGaDOzdU4Sbr3KBKGp6GHSfLwQ1icG9W8ekQa2ulIh7X8ulw85Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          庄园的海拔从 1400 米到 1550 米不等。巴霍莫诺（Bajo Mono）地块是当地数一数二适合种植优质咖啡的地区，这里拥有得天独厚的火山土壤，清澈的泉水，还有出名的被当地人称为“Bajareque”巴哈雷克薄雾气候现象，当太平洋与大西洋的水气相遇，在风起的时候，在山间升起阵阵薄雾，还能经常看见彩虹，所有的这些形成了独特小气候，使得该地区的咖啡树得以更好的生长环境和品质。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjXgq6sw1LLmyovqFP1c4ibwv9HkX1KgxHQ69tTKf7xxib08YZFIrrgYro8dS5FwnzFsic4dgMIFSzw/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style='caret-color: rgb(34, 34, 34);color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);'>\n          Stefan Arwed Müller\n         </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          蒂亚诺斯（Dianous）家族在 1914 年移民到博奎特地区， 加布里埃尔•蒂亚诺思在巴霍莫诺买下了第一个咖啡农场，从此开始了咖啡生意。庄园名“唐本杰咖啡庄园（Café Don Benjie）“， 荷西•本杰明•蒂亚诺思•恩里克先生，被镇上的邻里称为本杰明先生，他一直是个咖啡深度爱好者，是波魁特咖啡社区的积极成员，不断追求更高品质咖啡。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          Hacienda Bajo Mono 最初由一位美国女士阿切尔夫人拥有，她是博奎特的先驱者之一。 巴拿马著名儿科医生 Renan Esquivel 博士于 20 世纪 80 年代购买了该农场。 他是一位自然爱好者，种植了许多外来的树木、植物和咖啡品种，这些都被保存了下来。\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           新主人 Jose Benjamin de Dianous G. 和 Stefan Arwed Müller 于 2011 年购买了Bajo Mono开始经营，致力于提高质量和保护环境。\n          </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           庄园的品牌和商业名称是 Café Don Benjie（地块或者农场名是\n           <span style='font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n            Bajo Mono）\n           </span>\n           ，以向 Benjamin de Dianous Henriquez 先生致敬，他在博克特镇被称为 Don Benjie，他一直是一名咖啡爱好者，为博克特小镇和咖啡事业做出了贡献。\n          </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n           庄园种植品种有 铁皮卡，卡杜艾（红/黄），瑰夏，玛拉戈吉佩（象豆），波旁（红/粉红/橙），帕卡玛拉，摩卡和肯尼亚SL系列等。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            庄园这些年也不断更新，始终追求卓越品质，保护环境和员工福祉。 生产微批量的精品咖啡都是按品种精心采摘的，然后按照天然咖啡进行加工、水洗、半水洗、机器干燥或晒干（\n            <span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             水洗处理在加工时只使用非常有限的泉水，以对环境做出贡献，\n            </span>\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n             清洗果肉咖啡豆后，将它们在床上仔细地晒干）\n             <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n              ‍\n             </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n            在过去的两年中，庄园还采用了厌氧和二氧化碳浸渍、酵母发酵和其他实验工艺等创新发酵工艺进行加工，并取得了优异的效果；\n           </section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<strong>\n             “我们自豪地生产精品咖啡，关心环境和我们的员工\n            </strong>\n            。” - Cafe Don Benjie\n           </section>\n</section>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjXgq6sw1LLmyovqFP1c4ibof7nBPEnW3dvsgo6jxM1raLD2kAZwPE2eDBKpNZfzPx3fVoU6F7yJQ/640?wx_fmt=webp&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           // 关于Lost Origin\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</section>\n<p>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none;\">\n           “Always aware. Always curious. Crafting our daily dose.” - from Lost Origin\n          </span>\n</strong>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjXgq6sw1LLmyovqFP1c4ibgY62M2ovzicsOLZsPkKsdZTEuBV1f0uDnaa3ib1niaDiaJZOCowjO3EP1A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 347px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            故事的开始是这样的\n           </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n           ，\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍‍‍‍‍‍‍‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           在不断寻找新的灵感和风味的过程中，2019年的时候，他们（Lost Origin）听说在芝加哥有一家酿酒厂借鉴啤酒发酵（酵母、啤酒花）来处理萨尔瓦多的咖啡，这个发现塑造了他们建立属于自己的咖啡加工厂的想法。\n          </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           为了将理论付诸实践，他们首先联系了几家农场，并最终在2020-2021产季与桑托斯咖啡进行了合作。他们向桑托斯庄园展示了酵母、酶、营养物、啤酒花并为他们量身定制了一些处理方法。同时他们还联系了艾力达庄园，学习并分析了庄园在咖啡发酵过程中产生的果汁粘液，这些研究成果获得较好的反响，艾力达庄园主动寻求合作，为加拿大咖啡师冠军Monogram Coffee的Ben Put定制比赛批次。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           2022年，他们创造出了独特的咖啡处理方式，获得了巴拿马农业部门科技应用的政府赞助。这让他们能够建立一个先进的加工厂，并与专业领域建立合作，为咖啡处理创造一个充满活力的和极具创新的空间 - Lost Origin Coffee Lab。\n           <span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n            ‍\n           </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjXgq6sw1LLmyovqFP1c4ibXEGcXdLKv9r4cPibpJ3S3c7icjutNWISoAflyric8A6RoDEkjYKuiaHibQA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n           Lab位于巴拿马市中心的工业园区，一楼是啤酒酿造厂。这里距离最近的农场有8小时的车程。这里不是传统的咖啡处理厂，他们将酿造的协作和创新理念带入更注重传统家庭经营模式的咖啡行业。不需要明确的或是具体的咖啡处理方法，只通过不断试错、重来从而创新，咖啡处理领域已经很久没有发生过什么突破性创新了。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TaAmHIsobUMqz6JAvehbfnYLoXmicsIakykbOiae6QzEZdVvZ7IagEwI73WoorpAibTRZDia4Ria1ndQg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           冷链运输鲜果的包装方式\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TaAmHIsobUMqz6JAvehbfnSNtH2uNJX7kRIRLDWdicayVGdratHYBnorM3hgzbscaYTYibb6OtficSg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           脱皮第一道挑选\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TaAmHIsobUMqz6JAvehbfnDltiaRiaxHGc1eMlIgmAZL39BVfqywI75a3yIzOTX5YTOsR4QJ2rjiabw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           第二道挑选\n          </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TaAmHIsobUMqz6JAvehbfngw3Lf6mTajCYYKP7br1t0jX2S8IbSZJiaDb2RUhmBQA9CuOuTiaM6y5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           发酵房间\n          </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TaAmHIsobUMqz6JAvehbfnPosJJRiaHITy01oMplU7aHia5ONqmGXmKtSjWNXaD0Uo0e0ZEHnYvuWA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\n           可调温湿度的房间干燥（每格果盘铺5kg鲜果）\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n<span style=\"display: none;line-height: 0px;\">\n           ‍\n          </span>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           这里的咖啡在处理过程是：\n          </span>\n</section>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-1\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n             咖啡果冷链方式从距离Lab车程8小时以上产区农场运送过来\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n             运送过来后如果需要脱皮的话（脱皮设备也是定制的全部不锈钢材质保证清洁和杂菌污染风险控制）\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n             两个独立的空间分别进行发酵和干燥。发酵过程是在针对咖啡处理专门设计和制造的发酵罐中进行的，定制的发酵罐能够控制温度、压力和搅拌次数；干燥过程则是在他们的3阶段干燥室中完成，这个干燥室具有空气过滤、控制湿度和温度的功能。\n            </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n           Lost Origin团队有6年以上的啤酒酿造经验，这让他们深知微生物对环境测量、控制和净化的重要性。处理过程中所有与咖啡有接触的部件均采用不锈钢材质，这样不仅方便清洁，而且可以为处理过程提供干净的环境。他们专注于探索微生物对咖啡的影响和它们之间的关系。他们会记录并整理每次杯测的风味特征，这使他们能够了解并进一步利用每个品种的特性。在日晒或水洗过程中他们会加入酵母、菌群或两者结合，为微生物的生长制造最佳环境，以创造咖啡的独特风味。\n          </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;\">\n           地处“咖啡界的罗马”，他们拥有世界之最的巴拿马的咖啡；结合先进专业的处理法，在咖啡生产的不断探索中不断进步，并传播给巴拿马的咖农，为巴拿马的咖啡生产甚至全球的咖啡生产做贡献。\n          </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QjXgq6sw1LLmyovqFP1c4ibDNnicpxzlhFxGMBpibC0dpFICbgdlnORtmD8k1xQLmfpF80wvEt3jgjw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;font-family: -apple-system-font, BlinkMacS